@node Description "5D-ZippySearch Description"
5D-ZippySearch has been coded by SvEN tHE CREAToR/5D!

5D-ZippySearch is a replacement for the normal ZippySearch of /X!
@endnode
@node Installation "5D-ZippySearch Installation"
Copy all files which are in the archive bbs directory
to your bbs directory.

Contents of archive:
===================

BBS/
    Commands/
        BBSCmd/
            Z.info
    Doors/
        5D-ZippySearch/
            5D-ZippySearch
            5D-ZippySearch.info
            5D-ZippySearch.Guide

===================

@endnode
